        <h2 id="overview-en">MPSC Exam Overview</h2>
        <p>
          The <strong>Maharashtra Public Service Commission (MPSC)</strong> is a state administrative body responsible for recruiting officers for various Grade A, Grade B, and Grade C civil service jobs in the Maharashtra government. Popular posts recruited through these exams include Deputy Collector, DSP, Tehsildar, Block Development Officer, Sales Tax Inspector, and Police Sub-Inspector.
        </p>

        <!-- Key Information Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6">
