            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 id="eligibility-en">Eligibility Criteria (Qualifications & Age Limit)</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Nationality:</strong> Candidates must be citizens of India. Preference is given to Maharashtra Domicile holders.</li>
          <li><strong>Educational Background:</strong> A bachelor's degree in any discipline from a recognized university. Candidates in their final year of graduation can also appear for the prelims exam.</li>
          <li><strong>Age Limit:</strong> Open category candidates must be between 19 and 38 years old. Reserved category candidates get a relaxation of up to 43 years.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="exam-pattern-en">Exam Pattern & Selection Process</h2>
        <p>The recruitment process contains three consecutive stages:</p>
        
        <div class="space-y-6 pl-2 border-l-2 border-primary/30 my-6">
          <div class="relative pl-8">
            <span class="absolute left-[-1.05rem] top-0.5 flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-bold">1</span>
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold m-0 mb-1">Stage 1: Preliminary Examination</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-muted m-0">An objective type test comprising Paper I (General Studies) and Paper II (CSAT). Candidates must score qualifying marks in CSAT to get evaluated on Paper I.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative pl-8">
            <span class="absolute left-[-1.05rem] top-0.5 flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-bold">2</span>
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold m-0 mb-1">Stage 2: Mains Examination</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-muted m-0">A descriptive-style exam (following the UPSC pattern for Civil Services) that covers comprehensive general studies papers alongside language papers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative pl-8">
            <span class="absolute left-[-1.05rem] top-0.5 flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-bold">3</span>
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold m-0 mb-1">Stage 3: Interview / Personality Test</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-muted m-0">A personal interview panel testing candidate suitability, mental alert, and administrative aptitude.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

